# Parakeet Hub — Privacy Policy

**Effective date:** November 9, 2026
**Developer:** AxiomaraGames
**Contact:** axiomaragames@gmail.com

Parakeet Hub ("the app") is a care companion for parakeets and budgies: species profiles, care, diet, health, training, enrichment, behaviour and breeding guides, a food checker, a symptom checker, a new-owner checklist, budgie colour varieties, tips, a quiz, and profiles and care reminders for your own birds. This policy explains what information the app handles, and lists the credits and licences of everything the app is built with.

## Summary

The app does not collect, transmit, sell or share any personal data. Everything you add to it stays on your device.

## Information the app stores on your device

To work, the app saves the following, **only on your device**:

- **My Birds:** the birds you add, with the name, species, sex, approximate birthday and weights you give them, and a photo if you choose one
- **Care reminders:** your reminders, how often they repeat and when you last did them
- **Favourites:** the species you save
- **New-owner checklist:** which items you have ticked
- **Quiz scores:** your best score per quiz topic
- **Settings:** whether you have seen the welcome screen and your notification setting

The app comes with no example birds, reminders or favourites: it only holds what you put in yourself.

This information is never sent to us or to anyone else. It is deleted when you uninstall the app or clear its data in your device's settings.

**Photos:** when you give one of your birds a photo, you choose a picture on your device. The app keeps a small copy in its own private storage to show on the bird's profile. It is never uploaded. The app does not use the camera itself.

**Notifications:** if you allow them, the app shows one daily notification listing the care reminders that are due. It is created on your device; no notification server is involved.

## Purchases

The app is free to download. The full version is a one-time in-app purchase made through Google Play. Google Play handles the payment under Google's own terms and privacy policy; we never see your payment details. The app only asks Google Play whether the full version has been bought on your Google account, so it can unlock it, also after a reinstall or on a new device.

## What the app does not do

- It does not ask you to create an account or sign in.
- It does not connect to our servers or any other server, apart from Google Play for the purchase described above. All profiles, guides and pictures are built into the app.
- It does not collect analytics, crash reports, location, contacts or device identifiers.
- It does not show ads and contains no advertising or tracking software.
- It does not use your camera or microphone.

## Health information

The care and health information in the app is general guidance for bird owners. It is not veterinary advice and does not replace a visit to an avian vet. When your bird seems unwell, contact a vet.

## Children

The app is a general reference about pet birds and is not directed at children. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone, including children, because we collect no information at all.

## Changes to this policy

If this policy changes, the new version will be published at this address with a new effective date. Because the app collects no data, any change will not affect information you have already given us.

## Contact

Questions about this policy: axiomaragames@gmail.com

